{
  "comment": "Canonical per-model billing expressions for OpenAI models served through CPA. Coefficients are official $/1M token prices; the billingexpr engine converts rawCost/1e6*QuotaPerUnit to quota. p is prompt tokens net of cache sub-categories (the engine subtracts cr/cc when the expression references them); len is the full input context length used for tier selection. Apply with billing_setting.billing_mode=tiered_expr and billing_setting.billing_expr.",
  "official_source": "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/pricing (retrieved 2026-09-05)",
  "tier_boundary_tokens": 272000,
